  kind: 1
  title: "\u0110\xEAm nh\xE0 \u2014 ng\xE0y 2 (th\u01B0 gi\xE3n)"
  intro: "\xD4n ki\u1EC3u chill: tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng sao. S\xE1ng
    mai tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp m\u1EDBi \"h\u01A1i\" g\u1EAFt h\u01A1n."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] Ch\u1ECDn ph\xE1t bi\u1EC3u '\u0111\xFAng
      tinh th\u1EA7n' sinh vi\xEAn:"
    options:
    - "T\xF4i ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n 10 ph\xFAt (\xD724)"
    - "T\xF4i l\xE0m nhanh khi\u2026 \u0111\xE3 mu\u1ED9n"
    - "T\xF4i h\u1ECDc theo batch \u2014 m\u1ED7i h\u1ECDc k\u1EF3 m\u1ED9t batch"
    - "T\xF4i kh\xF4ng stress, stress l\xE0\u2026 b\u1EA1n th\xE2n"
    correctIndex: 1
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] Khi n\xE3o b\u1EA1n b\u1EA3o '\u0111\xF3i
      ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c' nh\u01B0ng mi\u1EC7ng b\u1EA3o '\u0111\xF3i m\xEC', b\u1EA1n
      l\xE0m g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "Th\u1ECFa hi\u1EC7p: h\u1ECDc m\u1ED9t ch\u01B0\u01A1ng, \u0103n m\u1ED9t
      g\xF3i"
    - "Gi\u1EA3 v\u1EDD \u0111\u1ECDc ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1 trong khi h\xFAp m\xEC"
    - "\u0110\u0103ng story than th\u1EDF"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u \u1ED5n"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] V\xEC sao l\u1ECBch b\xE1o '2' l\u1EA1i
      c\u0103ng?"
    options:
    - "V\xEC c\xF3 ch\u1EEF '{d}'"
    - "V\xEC th\u1EDDi gian kh\xF4ng wait"
    - "V\xEC messenger hay ping"
    - "V\xEC cosmic radiation"
    correctIndex: 1
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] T\u1ED1i \u0111\u1EB9p nh\u1EA5t
      c\u1EE7a sinh vi\xEAn l\xE0 t\u1ED1i n\xE0o?"
    options:
    - "T\u1ED1i kh\xF4ng h\u1ECDc nh\u01B0ng t\u1EF1 tin"
    - "T\u1ED1i h\u1ECDc 20 ph\xFAt r\u1ED3i t\u1EF1 reward 2 ti\u1EBFng"
    - "T\u1ED1i\u2026 v\u1EABn l\xE0 t\u1ED1i"
    - "T\u1ED1i c\xF3 snack"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 2] \u0110\xE2u l\xE0 'skill' kh\xF4ng
      n\u1EB1m trong syllabus nh\u01B0ng l\u1EA1i h\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c?"
    options:
    - "\u0110\u1ECDc l\u01B0\u1EDBt PDF 400 trang"
    - "Vi\u1EBFt mail xin deadline ki\u1EC3u professional"
    - "Ng\u1EE5y trang tab YouTube th\xE0nh Google Docs"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u r\u1EA5t meta"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
